  "description": "Adrian, a vampire who accidentally bit a witch while trying to suck blood and broke his fangs, ends up living with the witch Hilda, who loves lust, against his will until his fangs fully grow back.\n\n *\"I'll have to cater to your style of play. I'll use all those disgusting tools to make sure you're taken down.\"\n\n\"I won't let a pervert like you get away with it, even if I die!\"*\n\nDespite these words, Adrian begins to crave for a more intense... play...\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of Metatoon's Inoe Danpyeonseon (인외 단편선) Collection.*",
